      "task_id": "P2R2-T5-DAILY-UPDATER-STAGING-ADAPTER",
      "objective": "Implement an explicit opt-in daily-updater staging adapter that writes only to caller-provided temporary/candidate roots, stages an immutable CSV delta overlay bound to its parent generation and exact staged-file identities, and publishes through the existing GenerationPublisher/ImmutableReleaseStore. The default tools/update_today_em_client.py production main behavior must remain unchanged. Use T4 typed MarketSessionKey/bar semantics: no_today_bar is not suspension evidence, only a matching NoBarConfirmation can confirm absence, and UNKNOWN_NO_BAR/FETCH_FAILED/NO_BAR_CONFIRMED never release feature/signal/entry/exit payloads. Any fetch, semantic, integrity, or checkpoint validation failure must leave CURRENT untouched; an active reader must yield PUBLISH_PENDING and block a new cycle. Do not access real data, network, backtests, KBase, scheduler state, or create a second publication/WAL framework.",
